---
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';
import familyImg from '../assets/callie-family.jpg';
import { MM_URL } from '../data/site';
---

<section class="section alt" id="about">
  <div class="wrap about">
    <Image
      src={familyImg}
      alt="Callie with her two boys"
      widths={[360, 540, 720]}
      sizes="(max-width: 820px) 360px, 40vw"
    />
    <div>
      <h2>Meet Callie.</h2>
      <p>
        I'm a functional nutritional therapy practitioner, a functional blood
        chemistry specialist, a mama of two, and the founder of Macros and
        Mamas. For years I worked one-on-one with women on fertility, hormones,
        and gut health, reading their labs to get to the root of what was going
        on instead of chasing symptoms.
      </p>
      <p>
        Then I had my own kids and realized how little of the advice out there
        was written for this season. You're exhausted, you're feeding someone
        else all day, and every plan assumes you have time you don't have. So I
        built the program I wished I'd had.
      </p>
      <p>
        Working with me means we're a team. You're in the driver's seat. I'm in
        the passenger seat with the map, and I will never shame you about food.
      </p>
      <div class="creds">
        <span>FNTP, Functional Nutritional Therapy Practitioner</span>
        <span>FBCS, Functional Blood Chemistry Specialist</span>
        <span>Mama of two</span>
      </div>
      <div class="note">
        I'm not taking new 1:1 clients right now. If you want to work with me,
        <a href={MM_URL}>Macros and Mamas</a> is the place, and it includes 1:1
        messaging with me for all eight weeks.
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
